### Vehicle Re-ID Gate - ENROLL requests
### Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client) to run inline.
### Images are read from ../dataset/upload

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1) Enroll GIY034 - 20260810_161437_552.jpeg
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reid/enroll HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ReIdBoundaryGIY034

------ReIdBoundaryGIY034
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="LicensePlate"

GIY034
------ReIdBoundaryGIY034
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Images"; filename="20260810_161437_552.jpeg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../dataset/upload/20260810_161437_552.jpeg
------ReIdBoundaryGIY034--

